  "description": "A woman is reincarnated as the main character Rae Taylor in her favorite otome game *Revolution*. Given all the princes to romance, Rae's true favorite isn't any of them, but rather… the villainous lady Claire François! Leaving behind her cold and lonely past life, she will become the heroine of *Revolution* and adore Claire François to her heart's content! Will Rae be able to befriend and save Claire, using all of her wits and game knowledge of *Revolution*? \n\n“No matter what happens, I will protect Lady Claire!” \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
